        <ul class="features">
          <li>🔧 Developed microservices (Talent, Candidate, Recruitment…) to improve app performance.</li>
          <li>🤝 Implemented backend features in close collaboration with the frontend team.</li>
          <li>🧪 Wrote and executed technical, functional, and automated tests using RSpec and Cypress.</li>
          <li>♻️ Performed regression testing before production deployments.</li>
          <li>🗣️ Collected end-user feedback to enhance the app's usability and functionality.</li>
          <li>📆 Participated in Agile ceremonies: daily meetings, backlog reviews, retrospectives, sprint planning.</li>
        </ul>

